        // Since factory and royaltyRegistry are both address(this) in constructor,
        // we need to implement the interfaces. For simplicity, make this contract implement IERC2981 and IRoyaltyRegistry.
        // But we cannot modify InvMutTest. Instead, we can use a pre-deployed mock.
